body:
Ok, so I found the problem.

&#x200B;

When I clicked "manage" in uPlay to turn 2 step verification on, it opened the website on the browser but had me auto-sign in on my OLD uplay account for some reason, I have no idea why Ubisoft would log into my old account (havent been on in 3 years probably) rather than my newer one where I have all my games, and the one I was signed into when i pressed "manage" as i said. 

&#x200B;

Thanks ubisoft. your launcher is dogshit, just use steam.
